# The build context is os/rootfs/packages-src/, the producer family directory,
# and this producer needs two things out of it: the shared copyright file and
# its own control templates. Everything else -- the driver, the README, and
# every sibling producer that lands beside it -- is excluded, so an edit there
# does not invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The unit bodies and the HCI-attach program are NOT here. They arrive through
# the `radio-units` and `radio-hwinit` build contexts producer.env names, which
# point at the tree the stage chain ships them from, so that this producer
# cannot become a second copy of files that must stay byte-identical.
*
!copyright
!radios/control/*.control
